# The 3D Print group's icons (mitcad#1096, mitcad#1135): Send to Slicer
# keeps the printer, Printers… shows the printer with a gear, Processes…
# the printed layers with a gear, and they differ in the ribbon, the menus
# and the command search (they all take the command's action's icon); run
# by ui-print-icons-test.sh.
wait-idle
expect-command-icon make.print3d print-3d make.printers
expect-command-icon make.printers print-settings make.print3d
expect-command-icon make.processes print-process make.printers
expect-command-icon inspect.print_analysis print-analysis make.printers
